{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56838","headline":"陈七子题臙脂岩诗 · 不详","name":"陈七子题臙脂岩诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝游秦地暮嶓台，暂向人间独往来。\n家在碧潭深处住，从教清浅化蓬莱。\n（见同书卷一九○《洋州》）（〖1〗《舆地纪胜》：「陈七子，号休复。\n《兴元记》谓正元中居褒城，然非定居也。\n尝有人遇之於嶓台山，山高而秀，不与衆峯杂，势如耸台，上有臙脂岩、水帘洞、石焙拂焙竹、烧药炉、烧药台，下有清河水碧。\n七子尝题诗於臙脂岩曰〖略〗。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56838.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56838","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}